id=rustdesk_id_server
name=RustDesk ID Server (hbbs)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=deepseek
description=Run RustDesk hbbs ID/rendezvous server (and optional hbbr relay) on your rooted Android device. Set key to the configured value and expose port 21116 to use your phone as a self-hosted RustDesk ID server.
